1
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,190
Hana-chan.

2
00:00:06,190 --> 00:00:08,940
- Kau datang di waktu yang tepat.
- Hei.

3
00:00:11,590 --> 00:00:13,050
[Milik Gu Eun Ho]

4
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:22,950
Kerja yang benar.

5
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:27,620
Kelas praktik sudah dekat, dan
kerja sama tim itu kuncinya, 'kan?

6
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:38,590
Tunjukkan kekompakan kalian.

7
00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:41,250
Kenapa kalian bertengkar?

8
00:00:41,910 --> 00:00:45,800
Hei, kenapa kau melabeli barang dengan namamu?

9
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:48,220
Si Woo melakukan itu?

10
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:50,860
Aku tak suka barangku
berujung dipakai orang lain.

11
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:53,880
Jadi, aku akan mengurus
barang-barangku mulai sekarang.

12
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:55,170
Kau sedang puber, ya?

13
00:00:55,170 --> 00:00:57,150
Kenapa kau tiba-tiba bertingkah?

14
00:00:57,150 --> 00:00:58,880
Aku akan pindah.

15
00:00:59,990 --> 00:01:01,950
Itu konyol.

16
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,620
[Course Anthology]

17
00:01:12,210 --> 00:01:14,930
[Eun Ho]
Begitulah aku.

18
00:01:45,580 --> 00:01:49,160
[SMA Seni Segi]

19
00:02:12,620 --> 00:02:15,970
Ada yang mabuk darat?

20
00:02:15,970 --> 00:02:17,860
Bagaimana bisa kau jadi seorang manajer?

21
00:02:17,860 --> 00:02:20,260
Manajer harus menempuh banyak perjalanan.

22
00:02:20,260 --> 00:02:21,960
Untuk berjaga-jaga!

23
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:24,720
Aku mual saat kalian bertengkar.

24
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:27,070
Terima kasih, Hana-puf.

25
00:02:28,810 --> 00:02:30,600
Sangat menggemaskan.

26
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:36,580
Apa yang menggemaskan kali ini? Mabuk darat?

27
00:02:36,580 --> 00:02:38,320
Urus urusanmu sendiri.

28
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:42,470
Ya, wajar sih untuk orang yang
menganggap serangga itu lucu sejak SD.

29
00:02:42,470 --> 00:02:46,360
Buat perbandingan yang benar.
Jangan asal menyamakan.

30
00:02:49,330 --> 00:02:51,570
Kau duduk dengan siapa?

31
00:02:52,260 --> 00:02:54,430
Aku atau Cheon Si Woo?

32
00:02:57,890 --> 00:02:59,420
Ji Ah.

33
00:03:01,140 --> 00:03:02,830
Sungguh, mereka berdua?

34
00:03:02,830 --> 00:03:04,720
Memangnya bisa?

35
00:03:04,720 --> 00:03:07,540
Jadi, kau duduk dengan siapa?

36
00:03:11,050 --> 00:03:13,170
Baiklah.

37
00:03:13,170 --> 00:03:15,110
Kita bertiga bisa duduk bersama.

38
00:03:15,110 --> 00:03:17,100
Ayo.

39
00:03:17,100 --> 00:03:18,780
Baiklah.

40
00:03:20,190 --> 00:03:22,480
Berhentilah bertengkar.

41
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:24,460
Astaga...

42
00:03:30,690 --> 00:03:35,100
Kau bisa lihat 'kan ada banyak kursi kosong?

43
00:03:35,100 --> 00:03:36,560
Hana-chan.

44
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:38,370
Duduklah di sini.

45
00:03:38,370 --> 00:03:40,230
Berbahaya duduk di sini.

46
00:03:40,230 --> 00:03:41,870
Begitukah?

47
00:03:56,740 --> 00:03:58,910
Kau pakai parfum untuk orang tua?

48
00:03:58,910 --> 00:04:00,970
Baumu seperti pria tua.

49
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:04,400
Dan kau bau amis.

50
00:04:07,340 --> 00:04:11,230
Pokoknya aku jadi Harimau Putih
dan kau Naga Biru.

51
00:04:11,230 --> 00:04:13,510
Kau ingin jadi protagonis lagi?

52
00:04:13,510 --> 00:04:15,620
Itu kelainan.

53
00:04:16,520 --> 00:04:18,490
Mungkin tidak bisa disembuhkan.

54
00:04:18,490 --> 00:04:22,160
Pergi sana.
Kau tak menganalisis karaktermu, ya?

55
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,840
Mungkin kau tidak tahu caranya.

56
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:26,370
Hei.

57
00:04:28,900 --> 00:04:33,680
Maaf, aku mau tidur di sini.
Jadi, tolong pelankan suaramu.

58
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:46,820
[SMA Seni Segi]

59
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:25,890
Milik Gu Eun Ho.

60
00:06:48,690 --> 00:06:53,060
[Episode 6: Panen Musim Gugur]

61
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:07,560
[Kelas Praktik Gabungan ke-25 SMA Seni Segi]

62
00:07:23,950 --> 00:07:26,030
Kita sampai!

63
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:28,980
Apa itu?

64
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:43,890
[Milik Gu Eun Ho]

65
00:07:50,070 --> 00:07:53,500
Eun Ho benar-benar...

66
00:07:53,500 --> 00:07:55,090
Apa?

67
00:07:55,950 --> 00:07:58,950
Tidak bisa hilang.

68
00:08:02,790 --> 00:08:03,980
Kau sudah datang.

69
00:08:03,980 --> 00:08:07,610
Karena ada tes kamera,
aku akan menata rambut dan riasanmu.

70
00:08:07,610 --> 00:08:09,570
- Biar aku saja.
- Oh.

71
00:08:09,570 --> 00:08:11,560
Terima kasih.

72
00:08:12,740 --> 00:08:14,300
Gu Eun Ho, duduklah di sini.

73
00:08:14,300 --> 00:08:16,180
Kenapa?

74
00:08:16,180 --> 00:08:18,030
Aku tidak mau.

75
00:08:20,340 --> 00:08:24,940
Hana-chan, buat Si Woo kelihatan sangat
tampan sampai tak bisa ditandingi Eun Ho.

76
00:08:24,940 --> 00:08:26,400
Baiklah.

77
00:08:38,460 --> 00:08:40,070
Selesai.

78
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:52,610
Baiklah, sudah selesai.

79
00:08:52,610 --> 00:08:54,910
Kau hari ini tampan seperti biasanya.

80
00:08:55,510 --> 00:08:57,610
Terima kasih.

81
00:08:57,610 --> 00:08:59,870
Tunggu. Pakai lipstik dulu.

82
00:09:00,690 --> 00:09:02,350
Benar.

83
00:09:03,160 --> 00:09:04,620
Ini.

84
00:09:11,810 --> 00:09:15,110
Sekarang, kau benar-benar sudah siap.
[Milik Gu Eun Ho]

85
00:09:17,330 --> 00:09:19,120
Tunggu.

86
00:09:28,190 --> 00:09:31,620
Eun Ho benar-benar jahil, ya.

87
00:09:31,620 --> 00:09:34,720
Kau sebut ini jahil? Kalian bukan pasangan.

88
00:09:38,620 --> 00:09:40,380
Maaf.

89
00:09:58,960 --> 00:10:02,820
[Kelas Praktik Gabungan ke-25 SMA Seni Segi]

90
00:10:08,810 --> 00:10:11,730
Si-siapa Anda?

91
00:10:13,060 --> 00:10:15,210
Su-Sutradara?

92
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:26,830
Halo.

93
00:10:26,830 --> 00:10:28,170
Hei.

94
00:10:28,170 --> 00:10:30,970
Ini pertama kali aku bertemu Sutradara.

95
00:10:30,970 --> 00:10:35,270
Dia terkenal lewat film indie. Rumornya dia
akan buat film komersial pertamanya.

96
00:10:38,190 --> 00:10:41,620
Ini canggung, jadi duduklah.

97
00:10:41,620 --> 00:10:43,880
- Baik, Pak.
- Baik, Pak.

98
00:10:49,490 --> 00:10:51,450
Rasanya enak.

99
00:10:57,820 --> 00:10:58,970
Senang bertemu kalian.

100
00:10:58,970 --> 00:11:00,680
Halo.

101
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:03,300
Terima kasih sudah datang ke sini.

102
00:11:05,020 --> 00:11:06,670
Gu Eun Ho.

103
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:11,660
Boleh kulihat naskahmu?

104
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:22,570
Veteran kita ini tidak mengecewakan.

105
00:11:22,570 --> 00:11:25,280
Lihatlah.

106
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:28,150
Analisis naskahnya gila.

107
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:34,520
Pria ini sepuluh tahun lebih tua dariku.

108
00:11:35,390 --> 00:11:38,330
Senior Gu Eun Ho!

109
00:11:39,660 --> 00:11:43,220
Menurutku, naskah adalah tujuan kita.

110
00:11:43,220 --> 00:11:47,160
Tapi caramu ke sana dan dengan apa

111
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:49,290
harus diserahkan kepada para aktor.

112
00:11:49,290 --> 00:11:51,260
Terima kasih.

113
00:11:51,260 --> 00:11:57,590
Jadi, kuharap kalian tidak menunjukkan...

114
00:11:57,590 --> 00:11:59,380
akting yang terlalu klise.

115
00:11:59,380 --> 00:12:01,320
Penonton akan menderita.

116
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:03,330
- Baik, Pak.
- Baik, Pak.

117
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:11,300
Masuk diam-diam itu juga keahlian yang hebat.

118
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:18,580
Kelompok teratas langsung ke audisi final, ya?

119
00:12:18,580 --> 00:12:19,950
- Baik, Pak.
- Baik, Pak.

120
00:12:19,950 --> 00:12:26,080
Ini kesempatan luar biasa untuk kalian.

121
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:28,700
Dan kesempatan itu bergantung pada

122
00:12:29,390 --> 00:12:32,940
lima baris saja.

123
00:12:32,940 --> 00:12:38,950
Lima baris di mana Naga Biru,
anak buah Harimau Putih, mengkhianatinya.

124
00:12:41,390 --> 00:12:43,970
Kenapa hanya lima baris ini?

125
00:12:44,740 --> 00:12:46,380
Aku Shin Ji Ah dari Jurusan Manajemen.

126
00:12:46,380 --> 00:12:48,080
Beri tahu kami, Ji Ah.

127
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:54,620
Hanya butuh 30 detik untuk
menunjukkan kau di pesawat atau kereta.

128
00:12:55,960 --> 00:13:00,240
Shin Ji Ah, sampai jumpa...

129
00:13:00,860 --> 00:13:03,460
Ji Ah, kau luar biasa!

130
00:13:03,460 --> 00:13:06,680
Baiklah, para aktor harus bersiap
untuk tes kamera.

131
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:10,140
Para manajer akan mengambil catatan
latihan untuk diserahkan ke sekolah.

132
00:13:10,140 --> 00:13:12,370
Oke, cut! Selesai!

133
00:13:12,370 --> 00:13:15,000
- Terima kasih!
- Terima kasih!

134
00:13:24,560 --> 00:13:27,890
Mengkhianati pria berengsek itu?

135
00:13:27,890 --> 00:13:31,490
Takut? Kalau begitu, tusuk dia tepat di dada.

136
00:13:32,530 --> 00:13:34,010
Apa?

137
00:13:36,930 --> 00:13:39,810
Cheon Si Woo, kau Naga Biru.

138
00:13:44,700 --> 00:13:48,380
Punya banyak dialog lebih baik
daripada tidak sama sekali.

139
00:13:48,380 --> 00:13:52,260
Dan aku tersiksa karena satu kata, "Apa?"

140
00:13:52,260 --> 00:13:56,060
Aku harus menahannya agar
kita berdua bisa bertahan.

141
00:13:56,060 --> 00:13:58,520
Jadi, aku harus menuruti perkataanmu?

142
00:14:03,850 --> 00:14:06,870
Kau benar-benar kacau.

143
00:14:06,870 --> 00:14:09,900
- Hei...
- Berlatihlah dengan benar.

144
00:14:09,900 --> 00:14:12,180
Berhentilah memerintah orang lain.

145
00:14:18,970 --> 00:14:20,810
Eun Ho.

146
00:14:22,390 --> 00:14:25,600
Aku tahu kau tidak bermaksud buruk.

147
00:14:25,600 --> 00:14:28,490
Tapi itu seperti aku dan Suzu.

148
00:14:28,490 --> 00:14:30,960
Kau akan menyesali ini.

149
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:03,660
Juniorku tersayang, kau jadi
Harimau Putih atau Naga Biru?

150
00:15:05,980 --> 00:15:08,160
Kami belum memutuskan.

151
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:13,050
Kau sekelompok dengan tim Eun Ho, 'kan?
Kalian memperebutkan peran yang sama?

152
00:15:13,050 --> 00:15:14,400
Apa?

153
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:19,850
Oh, kukira kalian akan saling berebut peran.

154
00:15:22,810 --> 00:15:27,380
Kami tidak berebut, aku menantangnya.
Aku ingin mengalahkannya sekali.

155
00:15:27,380 --> 00:15:28,940
Kenapa begitu?

156
00:15:28,940 --> 00:15:31,180
Kau merasa dikalahkan?

157
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:35,500
Kurasa begitu.

158
00:15:36,750 --> 00:15:39,110
Begitu rupanya.

159
00:15:41,150 --> 00:15:43,690
Tapi ini yang kutahu.

160
00:15:43,690 --> 00:15:48,530
Karya sutradara lainlah yang
mendorongku untuk tumbuh.

161
00:15:49,640 --> 00:15:54,140
Kau bisa merengek dan mengeluh
sesukamu di sini,

162
00:15:54,140 --> 00:15:56,270
tapi itu tidak akan memberimu jawaban.

163
00:15:56,270 --> 00:15:58,840
Jadi, lanjutkan saja.

164
00:15:58,840 --> 00:16:02,610
Cobalah dan lihat bagaimana Eun Ho berakting.

165
00:16:02,610 --> 00:16:07,400
Mungkin kau harus fokus pada Eun Ho
dan mempelajari semua hal baik darinya.

166
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:09,200
Bukankah itu akan berhasil?

167
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,820
Aku akan pergi.

168
00:16:19,020 --> 00:16:21,080
Hei, Gu Eun Ho!

169
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:23,810
Si Woo! Kau datang.

170
00:16:25,950 --> 00:16:27,690
Kalian sedang apa?

171
00:16:34,250 --> 00:16:36,510
Kejutan!

172
00:16:37,160 --> 00:16:38,240
Soju?

173
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:39,990
Apa yang kau lakukan?

174
00:16:41,880 --> 00:16:43,630
Hei!

175
00:16:43,630 --> 00:16:45,160
Ini botol kosong.

176
00:16:45,160 --> 00:16:47,360
Aku mengambilnya untuk bermain botol putar.

177
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:50,420
Kau sungguh membawa botol kosong
dengan hati-hati.

178
00:16:50,420 --> 00:16:54,890
Ini semua karena pacarmu!
Dia takkan mengizinkan kita minum.

179
00:16:54,890 --> 00:16:57,440
Jadi, kenapa kau membawanya kembali?

180
00:16:57,440 --> 00:17:00,760
Kurang lengkap kalau belum main
Jujur atau Tantangan.

181
00:17:13,620 --> 00:17:14,590
Giliranku!

182
00:17:14,590 --> 00:17:17,400
Shin Ji Ah! Seberapa tinggi
peringkat grup kita besok?

183
00:17:17,400 --> 00:17:19,370
Pertama, tentu saja.

184
00:17:20,030 --> 00:17:21,480
Begitulah caranya.

185
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:24,600
Jika tidak mau menjawab, minumlah soda.

186
00:17:35,490 --> 00:17:39,080
Ba Reun, bagaimana awalnya
kau pacaran dengan Ji Ah?

187
00:17:42,760 --> 00:17:47,180
Aku memberinya gelang dan menyatakan cinta.

188
00:17:59,980 --> 00:18:03,420
Gu Eun Ho, kau suka Hana-chan, 'kan?

189
00:18:18,390 --> 00:18:21,350
Cheon Si Woo, bagaimana denganmu?

190
00:18:36,010 --> 00:18:38,320
- Hana-chan.
- Ya?

191
00:18:38,320 --> 00:18:44,700
Siapa di antara kami yang akan
kau beri "suka" untuk serial teman laki-laki?

192
00:18:48,010 --> 00:18:49,690
Eun Ho.

193
00:18:54,870 --> 00:18:56,620
Si Woo.

194
00:18:58,870 --> 00:19:01,290
Aku harus memilih keduanya, 'kan?

195
00:19:01,920 --> 00:19:04,600
Itu yang seharusnya dilakukan manajer.

196
00:19:07,580 --> 00:19:10,280
Kenapa menanyakan itu?

197
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:19,170
Sudahi saja permainan ini.

198
00:19:19,170 --> 00:19:21,730
Tubuh kalian tidak punya dopamin, ya.

199
00:19:21,730 --> 00:19:25,090
Ya, setuju. Jangan bertengkar lagi.

200
00:19:25,090 --> 00:19:28,110
Seharusnya kalian tidak ikut bermain.

201
00:19:33,780 --> 00:19:37,320
Apa permainan Jujur atau Tantangan
menyenangkan?

202
00:19:37,320 --> 00:19:39,350
Ya.

203
00:19:39,350 --> 00:19:41,690
Itu sangat menyenangkan.

204
00:19:42,660 --> 00:19:46,100
Hana-chan, ada orang yang kau sukai?

205
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:50,290
Aku lebih suka minum soda.

206
00:19:50,290 --> 00:19:51,890
Jadi, ada yang kau sukai.

207
00:19:51,890 --> 00:19:54,210
Tidak akan kuberi tahu. Aku mau beli soda.

208
00:19:54,210 --> 00:19:55,680
Astaga, siapa itu?

209
00:19:55,680 --> 00:19:58,890
Kita tidak bisa beli soda sekarang.
Semua toko sudah tutup.

210
00:19:58,890 --> 00:20:00,930
Kalau begitu... pertanyaannya tidak valid!

211
00:20:00,930 --> 00:20:04,840
Siapa itu? Kau juga merahasiakannya dariku?

212
00:20:06,460 --> 00:20:08,350
Rahasia!

213
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:12,730
Tunggu aku!

214
00:20:27,100 --> 00:20:30,240
Guru datang! Ayo berkumpul.

215
00:20:39,640 --> 00:20:41,530
Lelah sekali.

216
00:20:44,220 --> 00:20:46,470
- Semua sudah ada di sini?
- Ya, Pak!

217
00:20:46,470 --> 00:20:48,910
Selamat pagi!

218
00:20:50,520 --> 00:20:53,750
Kalian pasti tahu, kita harus bergerak
sepanjang menyampaikan dialog, 'kan?

219
00:20:53,750 --> 00:20:55,180
- Ya, Pak!
- Ya, Pak!

220
00:20:55,180 --> 00:21:00,230
Jadi, mari mulai dengan joging jauh.

221
00:21:00,230 --> 00:21:01,550
Bagus.

222
00:21:01,550 --> 00:21:05,080
Kelompok yang kembali pertama
akan mendapatkan...

223
00:21:05,080 --> 00:21:07,910
lima poin ekstra.

224
00:21:07,910 --> 00:21:10,400
- Kedengarannya bagus.
- Lima poin.

225
00:21:11,670 --> 00:21:15,660
Baiklah, berlarilah seolah-olah
nyawa kalian dipertaruhkan.

226
00:21:15,660 --> 00:21:17,450
Ayo.

227
00:21:18,040 --> 00:21:20,720
Di sana.

228
00:21:21,600 --> 00:21:23,720
Pastikan kalian tidak terluka.

229
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:25,360
Siap...

230
00:21:28,180 --> 00:21:29,960
- Kalian pasti bisa!
- Semangat!

231
00:21:29,960 --> 00:21:32,670
- Eun Ho, Si Woo! Lakukan yang terbaik!
- Semangati mereka.

232
00:21:32,670 --> 00:21:35,080
- Baik, Pak.
- Baik, Pak.

233
00:21:35,080 --> 00:21:37,650
Kenapa dia lamban sekali?

234
00:21:37,650 --> 00:21:40,180
Ba Reun! Lebih cepat!

235
00:21:40,180 --> 00:21:41,700
Lari!

236
00:21:41,700 --> 00:21:43,630
Kau pasti bisa!

237
00:21:45,150 --> 00:21:46,930
- Ba Reun!
- Lari!

238
00:21:46,930 --> 00:21:49,270
Lebih cepat!

239
00:21:49,270 --> 00:21:51,750
- Ayo!
- Nam Min Soo! Lari lebih cepat!

240
00:21:51,750 --> 00:21:54,900
Ayo, ayo, ayo!

241
00:21:58,450 --> 00:22:00,400
Astaga.

242
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:03,030
Kau tidak enak badan?

243
00:22:03,030 --> 00:22:05,120
Lari sana!

244
00:22:06,550 --> 00:22:08,470
Bagus!

245
00:22:08,470 --> 00:22:09,870
Teruslah berlari!

246
00:22:09,870 --> 00:22:12,000
Lari! Cepat!

247
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:15,340
Tiga putaran lagi.

248
00:22:15,340 --> 00:22:18,470
Aku lupa menekannya.

249
00:22:24,010 --> 00:22:28,140
Jangan memaksakan diri!
Pastikan kalian tidak terluka!

250
00:22:36,440 --> 00:22:38,260
Ayo, tinggal beberapa putaran lagi.

251
00:22:38,260 --> 00:22:41,350
- Dia sudah tiduran?
- Apa yang kau lakukan?

252
00:22:43,090 --> 00:22:45,700
Kalian pasti bisa!

253
00:22:45,700 --> 00:22:49,820
Jujur saja. Kapan kau mulai
jatuh cinta kepadanya?

254
00:22:58,530 --> 00:23:00,670
Sudah selesai.

255
00:23:00,670 --> 00:23:05,410
Aku juga akan menjadi
seseorang yang kau butuhkan.

256
00:23:08,380 --> 00:23:10,280
Sudah cukup lama.

257
00:23:10,280 --> 00:23:11,890
Bagaimana denganmu?

258
00:23:28,660 --> 00:23:31,620
Hana-chan.

259
00:23:34,870 --> 00:23:36,100
Baiklah.

260
00:23:36,100 --> 00:23:38,240
Selesai.

261
00:23:38,240 --> 00:23:40,500
Cantik sekali.

262
00:23:48,980 --> 00:23:51,100
[Hana, Si Woo]

263
00:23:56,890 --> 00:24:00,060
[Dan Eun Ho]

264
00:24:01,440 --> 00:24:03,740
Lebih lama darimu.

265
00:24:06,330 --> 00:24:09,880
Kau yang terakhir.

266
00:24:09,880 --> 00:24:12,410
Putaran terakhir!

267
00:24:12,410 --> 00:24:15,040
Mereka berdua sangat cepat.

268
00:24:19,490 --> 00:24:22,290
Sedikit lagi!

269
00:24:25,940 --> 00:24:28,060
Baik.

270
00:24:34,080 --> 00:24:36,040
Cut, cut, cut!

271
00:24:40,050 --> 00:24:42,560
Anak-anak nakal ini, sial.

272
00:24:42,560 --> 00:24:44,090
Hentikan ini!

273
00:24:44,090 --> 00:24:46,700
Kelompok kita benar-benar kacau.

274
00:24:46,700 --> 00:24:51,550
Kalian berdua tidak pantas
tampil di film Sutradara.

275
00:24:51,550 --> 00:24:54,300
Kau yang terburuk.

276
00:24:54,300 --> 00:24:56,710
Berisik sekali.

277
00:24:56,710 --> 00:24:59,010
Itulah masa muda.

278
00:24:59,010 --> 00:25:02,620
Kurasa begitu. Salah satu dari
mereka harus segera menyatakan cinta.

279
00:25:10,150 --> 00:25:11,470
[Kelas Praktik Gabungan ke-25 SMA Seni Segi]
[Upacara Penghargaan]

280
00:25:11,470 --> 00:25:14,670
- Selamat.
- Terima kasih, Pak.

281
00:25:14,670 --> 00:25:16,450
Jangan menangis.
[Kedua, ketiga]

282
00:25:17,400 --> 00:25:19,670
Selamat.

283
00:25:20,900 --> 00:25:26,520
Sekarang, tersisa posisi
pertama yang dinantikan.

284
00:25:27,460 --> 00:25:29,310
Dan posisi pertama...

285
00:25:33,780 --> 00:25:37,230
Posisi pertama jatuh kepada...

286
00:25:38,220 --> 00:25:40,180
Ji Ah!

287
00:25:40,180 --> 00:25:42,280
Ya!

288
00:25:42,280 --> 00:25:43,990
Bagus!

289
00:25:43,990 --> 00:25:45,520
Selamat.

290
00:25:45,520 --> 00:25:47,280
Selamat.

291
00:25:47,280 --> 00:25:48,700
- Bagus.
- Terima kasih.

292
00:25:48,700 --> 00:25:51,590
Ya, itu baru semangat.

293
00:25:52,360 --> 00:25:54,690
Baiklah, Anak-anak.

294
00:25:54,690 --> 00:25:57,600
Di Kelas Praktik Gabungan ke-25 SMA Seni Segi,

295
00:25:57,600 --> 00:26:04,420
para murid ini diberi penghargaan
atas penampilan luar biasa mereka.

296
00:26:05,610 --> 00:26:07,110
[Pertama]

297
00:26:07,110 --> 00:26:14,790
[Kelas Praktik Gabungan ke-25 SMA Seni Segi]

298
00:26:21,190 --> 00:26:23,860
Waktunya pulang.

299
00:26:25,180 --> 00:26:29,090
- Ayo.
- Terima kasih.

300
00:26:29,740 --> 00:26:32,680
- Terima kasih.
- Terima kasih.

301
00:26:32,680 --> 00:26:34,290
Sampai jumpa.

302
00:26:35,810 --> 00:26:39,630
Kerja bagus. Selamat, ya!

303
00:26:39,630 --> 00:26:41,380
Kita akan makan ayam tumis pedas.

304
00:26:41,380 --> 00:26:43,550
Hana-chan, mau ikut...

305
00:26:43,550 --> 00:26:46,540
Kurasa tidak. Sampai jumpa besok.

306
00:26:46,540 --> 00:26:50,100
Tidak, aku akan ikut dengan kalian.

307
00:26:50,100 --> 00:26:51,480
Ayo.

308
00:26:51,480 --> 00:26:53,090
Ayolah.

309
00:26:55,150 --> 00:26:57,790
Hei, tunggu aku!

310
00:27:08,580 --> 00:27:11,460
[Hana-chan, jadilah pacarku]
[Dari Si Woo]

311
00:27:12,600 --> 00:27:14,400
Si Woo.

312
00:27:14,400 --> 00:27:16,070
Hana-chan.

313
00:27:17,390 --> 00:27:20,270
Apa itu?

314
00:27:20,270 --> 00:27:22,370
Tunjukkan kepadaku.

315
00:27:23,030 --> 00:27:27,830
Kau selalu tersenyum, makan lahap,
dan sangat berani.

316
00:27:27,830 --> 00:27:33,450
Kau perhatian, cantik, dan menyenangkan.

317
00:27:35,330 --> 00:27:37,510
Tapi kenapa ini dalam bahasa Jepang?

318
00:27:39,350 --> 00:27:44,560
Intinya, kau gadis idealku.

319
00:27:47,150 --> 00:27:51,290
- Tapi...
- Bisakah kau jawab setelah memikirkannya?

320
00:28:11,230 --> 00:28:12,590
So Yeon!

321
00:28:12,590 --> 00:28:14,570
- Apa?
- Ayo ke kantin!

322
00:28:14,570 --> 00:28:17,920
Kau mau makan apa?

323
00:28:17,920 --> 00:28:20,340
Pertama...

324
00:28:23,350 --> 00:28:26,980
Waktu berlalu begitu cepat.
Ini sudah liburan musim panas.

325
00:28:26,980 --> 00:28:29,030
Kurasa begitu.

326
00:28:43,720 --> 00:28:45,960
Apa kegiatanmu akhir pekan ini?

327
00:28:45,960 --> 00:28:48,480
Ayo pergi kencan.

328
00:28:52,310 --> 00:28:54,300
Ada rencana?

329
00:28:54,300 --> 00:28:56,490
Apa yang akan kau lakukan?

330
00:28:57,360 --> 00:28:59,330
Kau tidak punya ide, 'kan?

331
00:29:00,320 --> 00:29:01,960
Sama sekali tidak.

332
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:19,440
Kau mau pergi ke mana?

333
00:29:19,440 --> 00:29:20,780
Aku mau berolahraga.

334
00:29:20,780 --> 00:29:23,420
Kau tidak akan menemui seseorang, 'kan?

335
00:29:24,090 --> 00:29:26,070
Kau tak lihat?

336
00:29:26,070 --> 00:29:29,230
Baik, hati-hati!

337
00:29:48,610 --> 00:29:50,830
Mau bertemu nanti?

338
00:29:51,550 --> 00:29:53,330
Hore!

339
00:30:15,640 --> 00:30:17,930
Sial.

340
00:30:17,930 --> 00:30:20,110
Kubilang ini kencan.

341
00:30:20,110 --> 00:30:22,680
Baiklah, terserah.

342
00:30:31,860 --> 00:30:35,010
Semua orang di sini. Semuanya.

343
00:30:46,440 --> 00:30:48,840
Kalian pakai baju pasangan, ya?

344
00:30:48,840 --> 00:30:50,210
Betul juga.

345
00:30:50,210 --> 00:30:51,860
Kau berolahraga?

346
00:30:52,830 --> 00:30:54,480
Pakai ini?

347
00:30:54,480 --> 00:30:56,340
Apa itu?

348
00:30:58,320 --> 00:31:00,050
Bukankah itu Min Soo?

349
00:31:00,050 --> 00:31:01,580
Itu dia.

350
00:31:01,580 --> 00:31:02,680
Di mana dia?

351
00:31:02,680 --> 00:31:03,930
Ayo ke sana.

352
00:31:03,930 --> 00:31:07,080
Di mana dia? Di mana?

353
00:31:07,080 --> 00:31:08,860
Baiklah.

354
00:31:14,430 --> 00:31:17,340
Ada apa ini?

355
00:31:19,960 --> 00:31:22,030
Tampak bagus.

356
00:31:22,030 --> 00:31:23,840
Hana-chan!

357
00:31:24,510 --> 00:31:26,420
Ji Ah!

358
00:31:26,420 --> 00:31:27,560
Cepat!

359
00:31:27,560 --> 00:31:30,100
Semua orang bisa datang.

360
00:31:30,100 --> 00:31:33,070
Kejutan! Selamat datang!

361
00:31:33,070 --> 00:31:36,160
Ini pemutaran serial di malam
pertengahan musim panas.

362
00:31:36,840 --> 00:31:38,660
Kalian berdua menyiapkan ini?

363
00:31:38,660 --> 00:31:41,400
Aku melakukan sebagian besar.

364
00:31:41,400 --> 00:31:43,910
Kita melakukannya bersama.

365
00:31:43,910 --> 00:31:46,700
Hana-puf sangat membantu.

366
00:31:48,590 --> 00:31:50,810
Eun Ho, bantu aku.

367
00:31:50,810 --> 00:31:52,590
Apa?

368
00:31:52,590 --> 00:31:55,390
Si Woo, kemarilah.

369
00:31:55,390 --> 00:31:57,750
Bisa bantu aku memindahkan ini?

370
00:31:57,750 --> 00:31:59,470
Bantu aku.

371
00:31:59,470 --> 00:32:01,060
Ayolah.

372
00:32:02,850 --> 00:32:06,540
Si Woo, ini jawabanku.

373
00:32:19,000 --> 00:32:26,090
Aku akan mendukungmu mulai sekarang,
sebagai teman dan manajermu.

374
00:32:26,090 --> 00:32:30,300
Terima kasih sudah menyukaiku.

375
00:32:41,820 --> 00:32:44,420
Aku akan memutarnya. Sekarang, ya.

376
00:32:44,420 --> 00:32:45,980
Cepatlah.

377
00:32:54,430 --> 00:32:55,920
[Mulai]

378
00:32:55,920 --> 00:33:00,030
Halo! Aku Hana Hirose dari Jepang!

379
00:33:00,030 --> 00:33:02,680
Tunggu. Berhentilah!

380
00:33:02,680 --> 00:33:05,090
Cukup!

381
00:33:08,810 --> 00:33:11,250
Kukira kau hanya bermain-main.

382
00:33:11,250 --> 00:33:12,510
Kau bekerja keras merekam semuanya.

383
00:33:12,510 --> 00:33:14,930
Hana-puf harus menjadi aktris.

384
00:33:14,930 --> 00:33:17,250
Kau tampak sangat cantik di kamera.

385
00:33:19,830 --> 00:33:23,210
- Syutingnya bagus.
- Kau bisa jadi manajer dan Hana-chan...

386
00:33:23,210 --> 00:33:24,990
Dan dia bisa jadi aktris?

387
00:33:24,990 --> 00:33:27,540
Min Soo bisa jadi manajer.

388
00:33:27,540 --> 00:33:29,020
Min Soo sebagai manajer?

389
00:33:29,020 --> 00:33:31,060
Tidak mungkin, aku harus jadi aktor.

390
00:33:31,060 --> 00:33:32,930
Ya, tepat sekali.

391
00:33:34,110 --> 00:33:35,760
Tepuk tangan.

392
00:33:35,760 --> 00:33:37,700
Tepuk tangan.

393
00:33:38,480 --> 00:33:40,520
Ini yang terbaik.

394
00:33:46,540 --> 00:33:50,140
Nam Min Soo, kau menghabiskan
banyak waktu merekam ini.

395
00:33:51,630 --> 00:33:54,350
Hana-puf yang menyunting.

396
00:33:54,350 --> 00:33:56,560
Dia bersikeras melakukannya.

397
00:33:57,920 --> 00:34:00,520
Saat menyunting,

398
00:34:00,520 --> 00:34:04,350
aku terkejut melihat betapa
seringnya aku tertawa.

399
00:34:07,250 --> 00:34:12,710
Semua orang membuatku sangat bahagia.

400
00:34:12,710 --> 00:34:15,550
Aku tahu aku tidak boleh tertawa.

401
00:34:15,550 --> 00:34:18,880
Tapi aku tak bisa berhenti
setelah mulai tertawa.

402
00:34:25,990 --> 00:34:28,560
Kenapa kau tidak boleh tertawa?

403
00:34:35,570 --> 00:34:40,180
Sebenarnya, aku akan
kembali ke Jepang minggu ini.

404
00:34:40,850 --> 00:34:44,380
Kudengar kondisi Suzu jauh lebih baik sekarang.

405
00:34:45,240 --> 00:34:47,060
Itu bagus.

406
00:34:47,060 --> 00:34:48,950
Tapi kau tidak akan kembali?

407
00:34:51,900 --> 00:34:55,010
Terima kasih banyak untuk semuanya.

408
00:34:56,400 --> 00:35:01,070
Kalian berusaha memahamiku dan menerimaku.

409
00:35:03,110 --> 00:35:04,970
Itu kabar baik.

410
00:35:04,970 --> 00:35:07,980
Kau harus menemui temanmu.

411
00:35:07,980 --> 00:35:11,690
Kalau begitu, mari bergantian
menyampaikan perasaan masing-masing.

412
00:35:13,170 --> 00:35:15,660
Nam Min Soo, kau mulai duluan.

413
00:35:15,660 --> 00:35:17,220
Aku?

414
00:35:20,240 --> 00:35:24,320
Sial, Hana-puf tidak akan kembali
dan hujan pun akan turun.

415
00:35:25,960 --> 00:35:27,640
Perlengkapannya sangat mahal.

416
00:35:27,640 --> 00:35:29,270
Sial. Teman-teman, cepat.

417
00:35:29,270 --> 00:35:30,550
Cepat!

418
00:35:30,550 --> 00:35:32,440
- Ini sangat mahal!
- Apa yang harus kita lakukan?

419
00:35:32,440 --> 00:35:34,600
Sial!

420
00:37:58,770 --> 00:38:00,420
Hana...

421
00:38:04,240 --> 00:38:06,200
Maukah kau...

422
00:38:07,170 --> 00:38:09,320
menjadi manajer eksklusifku?

423
00:38:18,490 --> 00:38:23,000
Kau pernah bertanya apa
yang paling penting bagiku.

424
00:38:25,300 --> 00:38:30,900
Apa yang paling penting bagimu?

425
00:38:34,460 --> 00:38:36,160
Itu kau.

426
00:38:37,110 --> 00:38:38,900
Hana Hirose.

427
00:38:44,370 --> 00:38:49,510
Aku akan pergi ke mana pun kau berada.

428
00:39:30,900 --> 00:39:34,720
Saat bersamamu, semua terasa romantis.

429
00:40:21,500 --> 00:40:24,620
[Epilog]

430
00:40:24,620 --> 00:40:26,530
Panas sekali.

431
00:40:27,200 --> 00:40:29,380
Kalian tidak kepanasan?

432
00:40:29,380 --> 00:40:31,300
Jangan sentuh aku!

433
00:40:31,300 --> 00:40:34,200
Astaga, dia cantik sekali.

434
00:40:34,200 --> 00:40:36,310
- Manis sekali.
- Di Jepang bahkan lebih panas.

435
00:40:36,310 --> 00:40:38,720
Kau akan jadi pangsit kukus di sana.

436
00:40:38,720 --> 00:40:41,850
Kurasa Hana-chan sudah jadi pangsit.

437
00:40:41,850 --> 00:40:45,670
Mari makan sesuatu yang
menyegarkan, seperti mi soba dingin!

438
00:40:45,670 --> 00:40:49,050
Itu lebih lezat jika makan di Jepang.

439
00:40:53,510 --> 00:40:55,210
Mau pergi ke Jepang?

440
00:40:56,610 --> 00:40:57,880
Aku sungguh akan pergi.

441
00:40:57,880 --> 00:40:59,210
Baiklah, aku juga akan ikut.

442
00:40:59,210 --> 00:41:00,970
- Sekarang?
- Ayo.

443
00:41:00,970 --> 00:41:02,150
Aku pergi.

444
00:41:02,150 --> 00:41:04,790
Tidak, aku lebih dahulu! Hei, tunggu!

445
00:41:05,460 --> 00:41:07,580
Tunggu aku!

446
00:41:07,580 --> 00:41:10,060
Kita harus menelepon Hana-chan.

447
00:41:14,950 --> 00:41:17,920
[Takdir]
